cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Buddhist Bridges: India–Korea Buddhist Mediators Dataset"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Khan
    given-names: Mohd Bilal
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: 3.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-17"
abstract: >
  Curated, source-graded dataset of documented mediators of India–Korea Buddhist
  exchange, 300–2026 CE: 76 people (43 carried after Buddhist-relevance
  classification), 41 travels, 30 texts, 31 institutions, 19 events, and 187
  graded sources, with per-record confidence, status, and date-precision fields,
  documented negatives, and a SHA-256-checksummed frozen release (v3.0_frozen/).
keywords:
  - digital humanities
  - Korean Buddhism
  - India–Korea relations
  - Buddhist transmission
  - prosopography
